🎉 PHP 8.6.0 RC7 is available for testing!

This continues the PHP 8.6 release cycle, featuring:

- timelib updated to 2026.03
- Fileinfo MIME detection fixes for TrueType fonts and HWPX files
- Use-after-free fixes in OpenSSL and streams
- array_map() optimization fix for first-class callables

… and more!

➕ Do: Test your projects!

➖ Don't: Run it in production. It's not fully ready yet.


🔗 https://www.php.net/archive/2026.php#2026-11-12-1

